          "method": "POST",
          "uri": "/api/projects/{project_id}/web_analytics_path_cleaning_suggestions/{id}/apply/",
          "code": 200
        },
        "smithy.api#documentation": "Apply a path-cleaning suggestion\n\nMerges the suggestion's rules into the team's path_cleaning_filters (never overwrites existing rules) and resolves the underlying health issue. Requires project admin, matching the team API's gate on path_cleaning_filters."
      }
