        "smithy.api#documentation": "Preview a path-cleaning suggestion on real paths\n\nApplies the suggestion's rules (in order) to a fresh sample of the team's top paths and returns before/after pairs for the paths that would change. Computed on demand; path samples are never stored. Nothing is modified."
      }
