          "method": "POST",
          "uri": "/api/projects/{project_id}/web_analytics_path_cleaning_suggestions/generate/",
          "code": 200
        },
        "smithy.api#documentation": "Generate path-cleaning suggestions on demand\n\nSamples the team's recent paths, asks the LLM for cleaning rules, validates them against the real paths, and stores the result as a `path_cleaning_suggestions` health issue (replacing any previous active one). Runs even if the team already has rules. Returns the suggestion (or a skip status when there aren't enough paths to suggest from)."
      }
